8. Hence, the following:
ORDER i) The appeal is partly allowed;
ii) The total compensation awarded by the Tribunal is modified and enhanced to Rs.5,96,400/- as against Rs.4,10,620/- with interest at the rate of 6% per annum from the date of the claim petition till its realization.

iii) Respondent No.3 is directed to pay the petitioner the enhanced compensation of Rs.1,85,780/- over and above what has been awarded by the Tribunal along with 6%
interest per annum on the enhanced compensation from the date of claim petition till the date of realization, within a period of six weeks from the date of receipt of certified copy of this order;
iv) Draw modified award accordingly;
Sd/-
